#. module: pos_enterprise_sms_whatsapp
#: model:sms.template,body:pos_enterprise_sms_whatsapp.sms_template_order_received_confirmation_pos
msgid ""
"Hello {{ object.partner_id.name }},\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for your order number {{ object.pos_reference }} for the "
"{{ object.preset_time }}.\n"
"You will soon be notified when your order is ready.\n"
"\n"
"{{ object.company_id.name }}\n"
"\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"{{ object.partner_id.name }}様\n"
"\n"
"ご注文ありがとうございます。ご注文番号： {{ object.pos_reference }} 、 {{ "
"object.preset_time }}\n"
"ご注文の準備ができ次第、ご連絡させていただきます。よろしくお願いいたします"
"。\n"
"\n"
"{{ object.company_id.name }}\n"
"\n"
"            "

#. module: pos_enterprise_sms_whatsapp
#: model:sms.template,body:pos_enterprise_sms_whatsapp.sms_template_order_ready_pos
msgid ""
"Hello {{ object.partner_id.name }},\n"
"\n"
"Your order number {{ object.pos_reference }} is now ready for pickup. Head "
"over whenever you're ready, and enjoy your meal.\n"
"\n"
"{{ object.company_id.name }}\n"
"\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"{{ object.partner_id.name }}様\n"
"\n"
"ご注文番号{{ object.pos_reference }}のご用意ができました。ご都合の良い時にお"
"受け取りください。ご利用ありがとうございました。\n"
"\n"
"{{ object.company_id.name }}\n"
"\n"
"            "

